431:The $\F_3$ lines through the $N(N-1)/2$ pairs of points of the capset have their third point in the complement of the capset, so if $N(N-1)/2 < 3^n -N$, there is a point in the complement not on any line through two points in the capset, hence the capset is not complete. 
